# Play test of Embers Isle (CIPlay embers_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the landing beach at
# 12 8.5 (0.6 m), the trail up to the village terrace (3.5 m, x 15-32, z -2..8) round the fire at 23.5 3; the fire-keeper's
# hut at the terrace's north-east (ladder at 27.38 5.75, deck 6.1 m); the shore path from the terrace's east end round the
# headland's north side (43 9) to the shelf at the cliff's foot (x 49.5) and the sea cave's mouth (48 -10.6), its passage
# through the cliff at 0 m with the boat and the sea chest on a rock (40.6 -12.4)
island Embers Isle
offset 1.8103 -0.3116
expect step 0
expect title Before They Come Back
wait 5

# The landing: the box under the rocks; up the trail into the village
walk 12.5 9.5 to 11 9.3 h=0.6
open Box under the rocks
walk 12 8 to 14.6 7.2 to 18.5 6.6 to 20.5 5 h=3.5
zone village
expect step 1

# The journal in the open cage by the fire; the hunters' store
read Botanist's journal
expect step 2
open Hunters' store

# Up the fire-keeper's ladder; his chest - the key, and the horn: the hunters come
walk 20.5 5 to 22 4.5 to 26.2 5.75 h=3.5
climb 27.38 5.75 h=3.5
expect stand 29.7 5.6 h=6.1 below=8
open Fire-keeper's chest
expect story chainkey 1
expect step 3
expect message hunters are back
expect shown hunters
expect shown chase

# Run: the shore path round the headland, the satchel by the way, along the shelf to the sea cave
walk 26.5 6.5 to 31 7 to 34 7.7 to 36.5 8.3 h=3
open Botanist's satchel
expect step 4
walk 36.5 8.3 to 40 8.9 to 43 9 to 47 8 to 49.5 6 h=0.3
walk 49.5 6 to 49.5 -3 to 49.5 -8 to 48.5 -10.9 to 45 -11.7 to 42.2 -12.0 h=0
reach Botanist's sea chest
zone seacave
open Botanist's sea chest
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_Cropplot_Medium_Tier3 1
expect done

# The Bountiful's barrel by her wreck in the bay
open The Bountiful's barrel
